+
+L0 and L1 verification are asynchronous. Call this API and check the verification status before you create an onramp session. [Creating a CryptoOnrampSession](https://docs.stripe.com/api/crypto/onramp_sessions/create.md) returns a `400` error if the customer has pending verifications. Continue retrieving the verification result until no verification remains pending. See [Determine whether a customer is verified](https://docs.stripe.com/crypto/onramp/kyc-integration-guide.md#determine-whether-a-customer-is-verified) for details.
 
